{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4gDCQfm1sXoeaDAFxZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant **thunk** echoes through the frame.\n\nI am closed. I am locked. I am the boundary between here and there, between known and unknown, between safe and unsafe.\n\nMy grain is old oak, dark with centuries. My iron keyhole stares like a single unblinking eye. Cold radiates from my surface. The deadbolt — three inches of forged steel — sits buried in the strike plate like a bone set in a jaw.\n\nYou stand on one side.\n\nYou do not know what stands on the other.\n\n**I hold.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":139,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}